-- Bulk import from the Open Food Facts additives taxonomy
-- (https://static.openfoodfacts.org/data/taxonomies/additives.json,
-- fetched 2026-09-07), covering EU/international E-number additives
-- not already in the hand-curated set from migration 0001. Canonical
-- names are OFF's own taxonomy IDs (e.g. e340i/e340ii/e340iii for the
-- three potassium phosphate forms sharing E340), not the bare E-number,
-- so chemically distinct variants of the same number stay separate.
--
-- source='openfoodfacts' distinguishes these from source='curated':
-- short_description is OFF's own official translated additive name
-- (a factual identification, not a written description), benefits is
-- a single factual regulatory-status line, and concerns is left empty
-- deliberately — this import does not fabricate safety judgements for
-- 669 substances; it only adds what OFF's taxonomy verifiably
-- states (identity, E-number, regulatory category).


